Package: clap-headers
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: CLAP audio plugin API headers
 The C headers of CLAP, the CLever Audio Plugin API, with its pkg-config and
 CMake files. Debian carries no package of them; this one exists to build
 CLAP hosts and is not published.
